        "id": 183557,
        "name": "Lord Flash Fire",
        "username": "Lord_Flash_Fire",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lord_flash_fire/{size}/2071_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-31T04:14:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Holy, it's done! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Congratulations, FearLord, and thank you for saving me from having to do this again cuz I tried at least three times c.c…Now for My Turn 3 after Oblivaeon comes out…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Would you count only the heroes who started the battle, or those who finished it without being incapped, or all of them? Too much complicated.</p>\n<p>EDIT: And would you count Scions, or would you count… (There’s a lot of different things to track. Especially if we get Environments into the mix (which would be a truly complete speadsheet)</p>",
        "post_number": 371,
