        "created_at": "2017-12-31T04:50:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Make it “OblivAeon’s Turn” and play the games necessary to have him destroy every environment and incap every hero.</p>\n<p>Seriously, just add the 22 new heroes and variants to the existing table. Dealing with scions and incapped heroes would be a mess indeed.</p>",
