        "created_at": "2017-12-31T14:28:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Before the most recent update, I'd figured it would be a matter of listing all the Scions and letting those determine the battle stats, but ugh, I think there's too much permutation. This is probably something the community should start figuring out how to track, though, for the statistics project if nothing else.</p>",
