        "id": 183560,
        "name": "FearLord",
        "username": "FearLord",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/5f8ce5/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-31T15:59:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think if it was done based on starting Scions pairs it would add a fair number of lines (Scion 1 is 1/5, but scion 2 could be any other Scion), but you could probably just list out each Scion as a single line each (so OblivAeon effectively adds 11 extra villains - perhaps just 10, as you can’t fight a Scion without fighting OblivAeon?).</p>",
